3. Make sure your generateDropdownOptions() is like this

Since your requirement is:

Location inactive → disabled

Customer inactive → NOT disabled

Billing Group inactive → NOT disabled

Tooltip only Location


use:

private generateDropdownOptions(
  entities: ContextEntity[],
  type: AddPanelType
) {
  return entities.map((entity: any) => ({
    value: entity,

    viewValue:
      type === AddPanelType.BillingGroup
        ? `${entity.name} (${(entity as BillingGroup).billingGroupId})`
        : entity.name,

    disabled:
      type === AddPanelType.Location
        ? entity.active === false
        : false,

    tooltip:
      type === AddPanelType.Location
        ? entity.facilityId
        : undefined,
  }));
}

This is important because your current code has:

disabled: !entity.active

which disables inactive Customers and Billing Groups too.


